xperience an ultra-detailed gibbing system where every shot dismembers enemies with gory details.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Epic Boss Battles. Face off against giant brain machines, and grotesque alien overlords.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the universe! Uncover secrets and hidden Easter Eggs across the entire game.</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dive into amazing locations: sci-fi space stations, cities, wild west, caverns, casino, crypto-mining factories, and more.</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Superior dynamically changing old-school soundtrack.</strong></p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Join BRUTAL JOHN and BRUTAL DOG in a ultraviolent old-school FPS set in a world overrun by crypto-mining technologies, where it’s up to you to destroy them and reclaim control. Prepare for an adrenaline ride that pays homage to the best shooters of the '90s.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain, Portuguese - Brazil, Simplified Chinese, Korean, Russian, Japanese, Traditional Chinese, French, Italian, German<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "reviews": "“I'm not kidding, I love this! BRUTAL JOHN is the coma dream that boomshots have before their family pulls the plug on them.”<br>Civvie 11<br><br>“BRUTAL JOHN 2 proves that the boomer shooter concept can still be fun when it’s done properly!”<br>GmanLives<br><br>“BRUTAL JOHN 2 is a through-and-through modern boomer shooter, and it’s a crazy one, to say the least!”<br>Brutal Zlim<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1859620/850badf8b2c596ce38ae679c6e1cbadb50cab3a9/header_alt_assets_5.jpg?t=1784936053", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1859620/e561c6f3accc2570fe094f4fa2c48423344c7149/capsule_231x87_alt_assets_